he application of the proceeds of the additional Term Loan B were as follows: (1) Term Loan A in the amount of $4.50 million, and (2) Term Loan B in the amount of $9.12 million.","context":"The Term Loans are guaranteed by certain direct and indirect subsidiaries of the Company, and are secured by all of the assets of the Company and such subsidiaries. The loan agreement contains various customary financial covenants and reporting requirements, as specified and defined therein. The Company was in compliance with all applicable covenants under the loan agreement, or if not in compliance with certain covenants had obtained a waiver from the lenders with respect to such covenants, as of and for all periods presented in the condensed consolidated financial statements.","section":"Segment Reporting Information","block":179,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-096016","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001083220","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1083220/000110465926096016/xelb-20260630x10q.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/65e29c00978462c00273e3a5070ec5802c36586efb67c97e174cff7b284f5c0a.bin","sha256":"65e29c00978462c00273e3a5070ec5802c36586efb67c97e174cff7b284f5c0a"}},{"id":"e3f5ba4b936bcae024a1d724c799ac157c752455498f7ac685971938b81a7e1f","quote":"In connection with the April 2025 amendment and refinancing transaction, UTG Capital, Inc., a Delaware corporation (UTG”), purchased a 100% undivided, participation interest in Term Loan B for a purchase price of $9.12 million. Also in connection with the refinancing, the Company issued certain warrants to UTG and Restore, and amended certain warrants that had been previously issued in December 2024.","context":"On April 21, 2025, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries and its lenders and FEAC entered into an amendment of the December 2024 loan and security agreement, which pro